00:02:52.100 --> 00:02:54.010
So what's this about?

00:02:54.510 --> 00:02:57.470
<i>Where's the puny one, your student?</i>

00:02:57.470 --> 00:03:00.280
<i>She's usually scamperin' all around...</i>

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:04.460
Well, this ain't a job.
What about that Haru-loser of yours?

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:08.350
Now that the three of you combined
finally equal one real man,

00:03:08.350 --> 00:03:09.510
he's pretty damn important.

00:03:09.510 --> 00:03:11.990
<i>- Bastard!
- Haruo's got a date today.</i>

00:03:11.990 --> 00:03:14.660
Oh, the usual boy toy?

00:03:14.660 --> 00:03:15.650
<i>Why, you little!</i>

00:03:15.650 --> 00:03:20.790
<i>Still, I'm impressed. You actually
came unarmed like we said...</i>

00:03:20.790 --> 00:03:23.780
Who needs guns to handle you guys?

00:03:23.780 --> 00:03:28.950
<i>If we showed up with guns, we'd obviously
shoot it out at some point...</i>

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:32.030
You'd be a waste of ammo...

00:03:36.910 --> 00:03:42.290
Listen. If they make any weird moves
at all, fill their heads with lead!

00:03:42.290 --> 00:03:46.820
<i>What great childhood friends;
he doesn't even trust 'em one millimeter!</i>

00:03:51.870 --> 00:03:53.110
<i>It's Haruo!</i>

00:03:53.110 --> 00:03:57.630
<i>Childhood friends sure
know how to think alike!</i>

00:03:59.090 --> 00:04:01.310
- Huh?

00:03:59.090 --> 00:04:01.310
<i>- You owe us one.</i>

00:04:01.310 --> 00:04:03.070
<i>We saved you, remember?</i>

00:04:03.070 --> 00:04:07.540
Huh? That was your job.
How does that make me owe you?

00:04:07.540 --> 00:04:09.510
<i>You're gonna help us with a job.</i>

00:04:09.510 --> 00:04:13.340
Oh! Why didn't you just
say you needed my help?!

00:04:13.340 --> 00:04:17.850
<i>We don't! We're only doing this
'cause Natsuko says to hire you!</i>

00:04:17.850 --> 00:04:20.100
Eh?! Natsuko's coming back?!

00:04:20.850 --> 00:04:22.010
<i>Brother's in danger!</i>

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:26.860
<i>Aw, crap!</i>

00:04:27.630 --> 00:04:29.110
<i>Dammit!</i>

00:04:33.970 --> 00:04:36.480
<i>- Hey!
- Stop! Stop it!</i>

00:04:41.140 --> 00:04:43.150
Can't trust you guys one bit!

00:04:43.150 --> 00:04:44.370
<i>Like you're one to talk!</i>

00:04:44.370 --> 00:04:48.020
So, is it true Natsuko's coming back?

00:04:48.020 --> 00:04:48.870
<i>It's true.</i>

00:04:49.450 --> 00:04:52.620
She works for the
Oasis government now, right?

00:04:52.620 --> 00:04:53.200
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:04:53.720 --> 00:04:55.930
So this is a government job?

00:04:55.930 --> 00:04:58.570
<i>Dunno. Says she'll explain
when she gets here.</i>

00:04:59.700 --> 00:05:02.260
So, when is she coming?

00:05:03.020 --> 00:05:03.940
<i>There she is.</i>

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:09.620
<i>Fuyu-niisan!</i>

00:05:09.620 --> 00:05:10.870
<i>Aki-niisan!</i>

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:12.070
<i>Haruo!</i>

00:05:12.070 --> 00:05:15.410
<i>It's good to see you, guys!</i>

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:18.620
Oh! You're so womanly now!

00:05:18.620 --> 00:05:19.720
<i>Kan-chan?!</i>

00:05:19.720 --> 00:05:23.650
Your boobs sure have grown!
Because of me, I bet!

00:05:23.650 --> 00:05:25.490
<i>Oh, you!</i>

00:05:25.490 --> 00:05:27.670
So, what's this job?

00:05:27.670 --> 00:05:31.620
<i>A request from the government,
of course. It'll be worth a lot!</i>

00:05:33.530 --> 00:05:37.270
<i>Wow! We'll gain prestige
doing government work!</i>

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:41.300
<i>Yeah, though this
ain't our first time!</i>

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:57.510
<i>West</i>

00:05:57.510 --> 00:06:01.420
<i>"Someone else is in trouble today!"</i>

00:06:01.420 --> 00:06:05.390
<i>"They're waiting for help somewhere!"</i>

00:06:05.390 --> 00:06:09.730
<i>"That's precisely when we come in!"</i>

00:06:09.730 --> 00:06:13.610
<i>"The hero of all, ally of the people!"</i>

00:06:13.610 --> 00:06:22.170
<i>"Oh, oh! The West Oasis
Handyman Guild!"</i>

00:06:23.740 --> 00:06:25.140
<i>"Southwest Road"</i>

00:06:25.850 --> 00:06:27.680
<i>Such incredible equipment!</i>

00:06:27.680 --> 00:06:30.840
<i>Well, it IS an Oasis government truck!</i>

00:06:30.840 --> 00:06:32.890
<i>It looks so powerful!</i>

00:06:32.890 --> 00:06:35.530
<i>Well, it IS an Oasis government truck!</i>

00:06:35.960 --> 00:06:41.030
<i>It's so awesome that Natsuko-san
is captain of this transport unit!</i>

00:06:44.030 --> 00:06:47.080
<i>"Water Station #6"</i>

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:54.190
<i>So much came out!</i>

00:06:59.100 --> 00:07:00.440
<i>Tube connection complete!</i>

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:02.240
<i>Open the valve!</i>

00:07:02.240 --> 00:07:03.640
<i>Commence suction!</i>

00:07:07.620 --> 00:07:09.390
<i>Master! It's sucking!</i>

00:07:09.390 --> 00:07:14.160
Well, it IS an Oasis... vacuum car...

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:15.630
<i>What's wrong?</i>

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:20.600
I was expecting it to be a big job
since it is for the Oasis government,

00:07:20.600 --> 00:07:22.160
but it's just shit transport...

00:07:22.160 --> 00:07:24.070
<i>Don't say that, Master!</i>

00:07:24.070 --> 00:07:26.710
<i>Even Natsuko-san said
that this is an important job</i>

00:07:26.710 --> 00:07:30.450
<i>to help support food production
in the West Oasis District!</i>

00:07:30.450 --> 00:07:32.950
Maybe so, but...

00:07:32.950 --> 00:07:34.810
<i>No usin' the john like some big shot!</i>

00:07:34.810 --> 00:07:37.290
<i>B-but I'll pee myself!</i>

00:07:37.290 --> 00:07:40.490
<i>You deserve to shit in the fields
for disobeying the Oasis government!</i>

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:43.010
<i>You bastard!</i>

00:07:43.010 --> 00:07:47.100
<i>Ow! What's the big idea?!</i>

00:07:47.100 --> 00:07:48.600
<i>Y-you're...</i>

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:49.960
<i>...the captain!</i>

00:07:51.570 --> 00:07:54.570
<i>Fertilizer is essential
for vegetable fields.</i>

00:07:54.570 --> 00:07:57.710
<i>It helps support life
in the Great Kanto Desert.</i>

00:07:57.710 --> 00:08:01.440
<i>Using violence against citizens
who help produce that fertilizer</i>

00:08:01.440 --> 00:08:02.810
<i>is the height of stupidity!</i>

00:08:04.350 --> 00:08:06.780
<i>I'm sorry! I'm sorry!</i>

00:08:08.320 --> 00:08:12.220
<i>It's all right now.
Please excrete with an easy mind.</i>

00:08:12.220 --> 00:08:14.110
<i>Thank you!</i>

00:08:17.030 --> 00:08:21.570
<i>S-so cool!
Natsuko-san is a skilled beauty!</i>

00:08:21.570 --> 00:08:24.610
That crybaby sure grew self-important!

00:08:24.610 --> 00:08:27.070
<i>There's no time for playing around.</i>

00:08:29.370 --> 00:08:32.980
<i>Master. You are childhood friends, right?</i>

00:08:32.980 --> 00:08:33.840
Of course!

00:08:33.840 --> 00:08:38.420
Me and Natsuko have TONS of
beautiful childhood memories!

00:08:38.420 --> 00:08:40.420
<i>It didn't look that way, though...</i>

00:08:40.420 --> 00:08:43.720
<i>We're going to the next water station
before the sun sets. Hurry.</i>

00:08:43.720 --> 00:08:44.850
<i>Yes, ma'am!</i>

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:50.430
<i>N-Natsu-ne is awesome!
She's so quick and efficient!</i>

00:08:50.430 --> 00:08:53.800
<i>That's a captain for ya.
They gotta be cool...</i>

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:57.200
<i>Don't neither of you be
screwing up and shaming Natsuko!</i>

00:08:57.200 --> 00:09:03.710
<i>Be as cool as always! Let's kick
a couple hundred bandit asses!</i>

00:09:03.710 --> 00:09:05.880
<i>It's almost like a picnic...</i>

00:09:05.880 --> 00:09:08.770
<i>Huh? Pic... niku (meat)?</i>

00:09:09.280 --> 00:09:10.540
<i>What meat?</i>

00:09:10.540 --> 00:09:12.890
<i>I mean you seem to be having fun.</i>

00:09:12.890 --> 00:09:18.180
<i>But of course we are! It's not everyday
we get such an honorable job!</i>

00:09:18.180 --> 00:09:23.130
<i>Only way you lame handymen
can get Oasis government work</i>

00:09:23.130 --> 00:09:26.260
<i>is by being lucky to have a
low-class captain for a sister...</i>

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:30.070
<i>What'd you say?! Did you
call Natsuko low-class?!</i>

00:09:30.070 --> 00:09:32.640
<i>We're hauling shit, you know! Shit!</i>

00:09:32.640 --> 00:09:35.110
<i>Ain't nobody would take this job!</i>

00:09:35.110 --> 00:09:39.900
<i>This crappy mission is perfect
for a lowly captain not from the Oasis!</i>

00:09:41.410 --> 00:09:48.040
<i>Which makes you the rotting shit
oozing beneath that lowly captain!</i>

00:09:49.070 --> 00:09:49.870
<i>Bastards!</i>

00:09:51.490 --> 00:09:52.260
<i>You want some?!</i>

00:09:52.260 --> 00:09:55.260
Yay! The rotting shit is mad!

00:10:03.420 --> 00:10:04.480
<i>Natsuko...</i>

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:11.110
<i>Sorry, Captain!</i>

00:10:11.110 --> 00:10:16.170
<i>We thought we would say hello
to the soldiers to be polite...</i>

00:10:17.350 --> 00:10:20.090
<i>Sorry! We'll get right back to work!</i>

00:10:21.050 --> 00:10:24.030
<i>We're finished here.
We leave immediately.</i>

00:10:24.450 --> 00:10:25.490
<i>Yes, ma'am!</i>

00:10:30.650 --> 00:10:32.320
<i>You idiot!</i>

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:35.930
<i>What're you shaming Natsuko for?!</i>

00:10:36.900 --> 00:10:39.900
<i>S-sorry! I just snapped...</i>

00:10:39.900 --> 00:10:42.210
<i>Do something about that attitude!</i>

00:10:43.320 --> 00:10:44.410
Totally.

00:10:45.110 --> 00:10:47.320
<i>Don't add oil to the fire!</i>

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:54.580
<i>Bodyguards?</i>

00:10:54.580 --> 00:10:58.190
<i>Yes! There were five handymen
besides the soldiers!</i>

00:10:58.190 --> 00:11:00.660
<i>Could they have found out about us?</i>

00:11:00.660 --> 00:11:02.890
<i>No, five would be too few...</i>

00:11:02.890 --> 00:11:05.500
<i>They're no ordinary five.</i>

00:11:06.200 --> 00:11:09.000
<i>One of them is the Sunabouzu.</i>

00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:10.510
<i>THE Sunabouzu?!</i>

00:11:10.510 --> 00:11:14.630
<i>Yes. The Ghost of the Desert.</i>

00:11:15.910 --> 00:11:19.430
<i>This'll be interesting, Sunabouzu...</i>

00:11:28.590 --> 00:11:33.730
<i>Master, what did he mean when
he said nobody would take this job?</i>

00:11:34.260 --> 00:11:37.690
Crap is valuable,
but not worth much money.

00:11:37.690 --> 00:11:40.360
If you wanna rake in the dough,
you need a big facility

00:11:40.360 --> 00:11:43.030
and hundreds of truckloads of shit.

00:11:44.170 --> 00:11:46.970
<i>It must be really hard to sell...</i>

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:50.710
If someone did go after it,
he'd have to be a real big shot.

00:11:50.710 --> 00:11:54.680
<i>No wonder there are so few people
on such an important assignment...</i>

00:11:56.480 --> 00:11:57.700
<i>What happened?!</i>

00:11:59.520 --> 00:12:00.470
<i>What the?</i>

00:12:01.420 --> 00:12:03.640
<i>Damn boulders are blockin' the way!</i>

00:12:04.250 --> 00:12:06.720
<i>You five handymen! Go check it out!</i>

00:12:06.720 --> 00:12:07.610
'Kay...

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:10.460
<i>Stay alert!</i>

00:12:13.160 --> 00:12:14.530
<i>What do you suppose it is?</i>

00:12:14.530 --> 00:12:18.080
It's just a cliché.
There can't possibly be any enemies.

00:12:21.910 --> 00:12:24.110
<i>Well? Can we get through?</i>

00:12:24.110 --> 00:12:26.410
<i>Maybe if we had some dynamite...</i>

00:12:26.410 --> 00:12:27.900
<i>Can't go around either.</i>

00:12:28.480 --> 00:12:32.150
<i>The sand's so deep around
here the tires would get...</i>

00:12:32.150 --> 00:12:33.580
<i>What happened?!</i>

00:12:33.580 --> 00:12:36.120
<i>Electronic jamming!
We can't contact anyone!</i>

00:12:51.200 --> 00:12:52.940
<i>It's a raid!</i>

00:12:52.940 --> 00:12:53.560
<i>A trap?!</i>

00:13:04.680 --> 00:13:09.920
Ow! Dammit! Thought I was
a goner for sure this time!

00:13:09.920 --> 00:13:11.430
<i>F-Fuyu-niichan!</i>

00:13:11.430 --> 00:13:14.260
<i>You OK?! Oh crap!</i>

00:13:14.260 --> 00:13:15.540
<i>Looks like he has broken ribs!</i>

00:13:15.540 --> 00:13:17.860
<i>Let's just hope his insides are OK!</i>

00:13:17.860 --> 00:13:19.700
<i>Let's get back to the truck!</i>

00:13:19.700 --> 00:13:22.000
<i>I don't think so!</i>

00:13:22.000 --> 00:13:23.990
<i>Master!</i>

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:36.250
<i>Yo.</i>

00:13:36.250 --> 00:13:39.880
Hey, Amagumo! What're you doin' out here?

00:13:39.880 --> 00:13:42.290
<i>You're the same as ever, Sunabouzu.</i>

00:13:42.290 --> 00:13:46.590
<i>I thought I'd settle
the score from the other day...</i>

00:13:46.590 --> 00:13:47.280
<i>No...</i>

00:13:47.820 --> 00:13:50.690
<i>Maybe it already IS settled.</i>

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:55.830
<i>Don't shoot!</i>

00:13:55.830 --> 00:13:57.600
<i>Don't shoot!</i>

00:13:57.600 --> 00:13:58.890
How pathetic...

00:14:00.940 --> 00:14:05.540
To think the South Oasis'
#1 repo man, Amagumo-san...

00:14:05.540 --> 00:14:07.810
...would stoop to being
a grubby little bandit!

00:14:07.810 --> 00:14:09.790
<i>And whose fault is that?!</i>

00:14:10.610 --> 00:14:14.720
Don't tell me it's 'cause you
screwed up all those jobs!

00:14:14.720 --> 00:14:15.360
<i>Quiet!</i>

00:14:16.720 --> 00:14:19.300
<i>It's time for you to die...</i>

00:14:19.300 --> 00:14:23.780
<i>I need to end this
before the smokescreen clears...</i>

00:14:23.780 --> 00:14:27.960
So he ordered that weapon
the other day just for this?!

00:14:27.960 --> 00:14:31.400
Which means he's completely prepared!

00:14:31.400 --> 00:14:33.280
This ain't good!

00:14:33.280 --> 00:14:37.810
Incidentally, you're after
the West Oasis truck, right?!

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:40.140
<i>Master's starting a cheap trick...</i>

00:14:40.140 --> 00:14:42.850
Do you know what's stored in that thing?!

00:14:42.850 --> 00:14:44.980
You'd be so shocked
and bummed if you did!

00:14:44.980 --> 00:14:46.710
<i>Shit, right?</i>

00:14:55.060 --> 00:14:57.320
You attacked when you knew it was shit?

00:14:57.320 --> 00:14:58.690
<i>But of course.</i>

00:15:06.140 --> 00:15:07.600
T-that's awesome.

00:15:07.600 --> 00:15:08.590
<i>I suppose.</i>

00:15:09.270 --> 00:15:11.530
<i>What's going on? What's the matter?</i>

00:15:12.610 --> 00:15:14.960
<i>He's frozen stiff!</i>

00:15:17.150 --> 00:15:20.040
<i>I've never seen him this nervous before!</i>

00:15:21.420 --> 00:15:22.920
<i>N-now I see!</i>

00:15:22.920 --> 00:15:28.050
<i>The fact they attacked knowingly
means the enemy is a real big shot!</i>

00:15:35.570 --> 00:15:38.190
<i>Blast! They got good recon!</i>

00:15:38.190 --> 00:15:40.040
<i>- Let's go, Haruo!
- Right!</i>

00:15:40.040 --> 00:15:41.560
<i>- Right!</i>

00:15:40.040 --> 00:15:41.560
- Jump on, Kosuna!

00:15:47.580 --> 00:15:50.210
<i>They have one exceptionally
attractive commander...</i>

00:15:50.210 --> 00:15:52.480
<i>I like ones like that...</i>

00:15:52.480 --> 00:15:54.480
<i>It's a shame the Sunabouzu got away.</i>

00:15:54.480 --> 00:15:57.650
<i>No matter. The plan itself
went perfectly!</i>

00:16:01.720 --> 00:16:02.680
<i>Natsuko...</i>

00:16:02.680 --> 00:16:04.590
<i>I mean, Captain...</i>

00:16:04.590 --> 00:16:06.730
<i>Could we stop by a town with a doctor?</i>

00:16:06.730 --> 00:16:11.100
<i>Bro doesn't look good.
He could have internal injuries!</i>

00:16:11.500 --> 00:16:15.810
<i>I can't do that. We're heading
straight for West Oasis.</i>

00:16:15.810 --> 00:16:19.840
<i>Returning this vehicle and cargo
to the Oasis intact is top priority!</i>

00:16:19.840 --> 00:16:21.510
<i>Then he could...</i>

00:16:22.280 --> 00:16:27.740
<i>The captain's right. If we lose
this car, we lose everything...</i>

00:16:27.740 --> 00:16:30.690
<i>It's best to haul ass
when you're in trouble!</i>

00:16:30.690 --> 00:16:32.050
<i>B-but!</i>

00:16:33.190 --> 00:16:35.560
<i>- How's the radio?!
- Still no luck!</i>

00:16:35.560 --> 00:16:41.900
<i>It's not that strong a signal,
so how can it jam over such a wide area?</i>

00:16:41.900 --> 00:16:43.200
It couldn't be!

00:16:45.470 --> 00:16:46.770
<i>What is this?!</i>

00:16:50.270 --> 00:16:52.870
So that's why!

00:16:57.050 --> 00:16:58.360
<i>Master!</i>

00:16:58.360 --> 00:16:59.280
Dammit!

00:17:13.160 --> 00:17:14.540
Akio!

00:17:15.060 --> 00:17:16.460
You take the other end!

00:17:16.460 --> 00:17:17.460
<i>Right!</i>

00:17:17.460 --> 00:17:19.400
<i>Shut this door and lock it!</i>

00:17:19.400 --> 00:17:20.140
<i>But!</i>

00:17:20.140 --> 00:17:23.270
<i>That's an order! It's all over
if they get the driver's seat!</i>

00:17:23.270 --> 00:17:24.190
<i>R-right!</i>

00:17:25.580 --> 00:17:28.240
<i>I'm going around left!
You better hold this spot!</i>

00:17:28.240 --> 00:17:30.410
<i>I know! Don't tell me what to do!</i>

00:17:31.450 --> 00:17:34.750
<i>Artillery gun's just a
decoration once they're onboard...</i>

00:17:34.750 --> 00:17:36.660
<i>It's so strong it'd destroy the car!</i>

00:17:36.660 --> 00:17:39.460
<i>This is bad! We gotta do something!</i>

00:17:39.460 --> 00:17:40.960
<i>Huh? Where's Natsuko-san?!</i>

00:17:40.960 --> 00:17:42.260
<i>- Eh?
- She's gone!</i>

00:17:42.860 --> 00:17:45.860
<i>Damn! She escaped into the driver's seat!</i>

00:17:45.860 --> 00:17:48.880
<i>Captain, my ass! THIS is
why low-classers suck!</i>

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:50.760
<i>You idiot! You'll be killed!</i>

00:17:50.760 --> 00:17:55.620
<i>Look at their shots! They're all
too high! They can't see us either!</i>

00:17:56.810 --> 00:17:58.780
<i>This is my chance to earn prestige!</i>

00:17:58.780 --> 00:18:03.490
<i>Even if you are low-class or female,
if you're good, it doesn't matter!</i>

00:18:04.280 --> 00:18:06.620
<i>What's this? Was this always here?</i>

00:18:06.620 --> 00:18:08.320
<i>Knock knock.</i>

00:18:08.320 --> 00:18:08.860
<i>Yes?</i>

00:18:16.930 --> 00:18:17.650
<i>Why, you!</i>

00:18:20.200 --> 00:18:21.500
<i>That was close!</i>

00:18:39.320 --> 00:18:40.340
<i>I knew it!</i>

00:18:41.120 --> 00:18:44.070
<i>She is a skilled beauty!</i>

00:18:44.790 --> 00:18:47.390
<i>Over here too, huh?!</i>

00:18:49.030 --> 00:18:50.860
<i>Hey, the gunfire stopped!</i>

00:18:50.860 --> 00:18:52.960
<i>They couldn't break through either side?!</i>

00:18:55.460 --> 00:18:57.270
Bastards! Die!

00:19:04.410 --> 00:19:05.710
<i>Ow!</i>

00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:10.910
<i>The rear enemies have been disposed of.
How about the front?!</i>

00:19:10.910 --> 00:19:11.980
<i>They ran off!</i>

00:19:11.980 --> 00:19:14.220
<i>Make certain none are left!</i>

00:19:14.220 --> 00:19:15.240
<i>Yes, ma'am!</i>

00:19:24.030 --> 00:19:28.030
<i>You actually would've died there.
Don't be reckless like that any more.</i>

00:19:28.030 --> 00:19:30.430
<i>R-right, I'm sorry...</i>

00:19:32.840 --> 00:19:37.310
<i>Thanks. To be honest,
getting on the tank was easy,</i>

00:19:37.310 --> 00:19:40.010
<i>but I couldn't find the
right chance to jump them.</i>

00:19:40.010 --> 00:19:41.190
<i>I owe you one!</i>

00:19:42.180 --> 00:19:44.270
<i>Yes! Thank you!</i>

00:19:49.020 --> 00:19:50.440
Yo, what's up?

00:19:50.440 --> 00:19:51.790
<i>Master!</i>

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:53.690
<i>Natsuko-san was amazing!</i>

00:19:53.690 --> 00:19:54.320
How so?

00:19:54.320 --> 00:19:59.460
<i>She suddenly showed up and went
bam-bam-bam to beat 'em up!</i>

00:19:59.460 --> 00:20:00.430
Huh?!

00:20:00.430 --> 00:20:04.100
<i>It was like, you know... him!</i>

00:20:04.100 --> 00:20:06.340
<i>She used the same moves Kaido Masaru did!</i>

00:20:13.010 --> 00:20:13.810
<i>How is he?!</i>

00:20:13.810 --> 00:20:16.210
<i>H-he's okay! He's asleep!</i>

00:20:16.210 --> 00:20:19.150
<i>T-this person just
gave him some morphine!</i>

00:20:30.960 --> 00:20:33.300
<i>This'll take until morning to fix...</i>

00:20:33.300 --> 00:20:36.100
<i>I sure wish we could use
the radio to call for help...</i>

00:20:36.100 --> 00:20:40.840
<i>Yeah. Dammit, where the hell's
that jamming signal coming from?!</i>

00:20:40.840 --> 00:20:44.540
<i>Speaking of which, did you
hear what that runt was saying?</i>

00:20:44.540 --> 00:20:47.310
<i>About how the captain used martial arts?</i>

00:20:47.310 --> 00:20:50.180
<i>That means she had special training...</i>

00:20:50.180 --> 00:20:54.320
<i>How was she able to do special
training when she was born a civilian?</i>

00:20:54.320 --> 00:20:59.880
<i>Who knows. But this obviously ain't
just a shit-transporting mission.</i>

00:21:01.060 --> 00:21:06.870
<i>How rare for you to look so
serious when you wanna talk to us...</i>

00:21:07.330 --> 00:21:09.800
There's too much I don't like about this.

00:21:09.800 --> 00:21:12.100
About the enemies' methods and Natsuko...

00:21:14.140 --> 00:21:16.110
<i>You got a problem with Natsuko?!</i>

00:21:16.110 --> 00:21:19.710
It ain't like that.
Just, doesn't it seem weird?

00:21:19.710 --> 00:21:21.280
<i>What's weird?!</i>

00:21:21.280 --> 00:21:27.050
Just to steal some crap, they had
all that military might ready to go...

00:21:27.050 --> 00:21:29.250
I just can't figure out
what they were after.

00:21:29.250 --> 00:21:32.280
<i>Yeah, I've been
wonderin' about that myself.</i>

00:21:33.060 --> 00:21:34.820
<i>But what's wrong with Natsuko?!</i>

00:21:34.820 --> 00:21:38.960
I realized it after today's battle.
She's an incredible commander.

00:21:38.960 --> 00:21:41.270
They'd never stick her
with an assignment like this.

00:21:41.630 --> 00:21:43.690
There's gotta be another side to it.

00:21:46.470 --> 00:21:48.290
Right, Natsuko-chan?

00:21:50.570 --> 00:21:53.230
<i>N-Natsu-ne...</i>

00:22:01.620 --> 00:22:05.930
You gonna shut me up? Or maybe...

00:22:05.930 --> 00:22:08.610
- you wanna continue
where we left off?

00:23:55.980 --> 00:23:58.180
<i>Yo! Ghost of the Desert,
Sunabouzu here! On the next episode!</i>

00:23:58.180 --> 00:24:01.450
<i>- Am I really reading this sub-title?!
- Just sock it to 'em!</i>

00:24:02.770 --> 00:24:04.230
<i>No, I can't, Master!</i>

00:24:04.230 --> 00:24:05.340
<i>You good-for-nothing!</i>

00:24:05.340 --> 00:24:06.580
<i>Next episode- "Feces and Urine"</i>

00:24:06.580 --> 00:24:08.380
<i>You're so incredible, Natsuko-san!</i>

00:24:08.380 --> 00:24:10.610
<i>- Miss it and I'll shoot you dead.
- Eh?!</i>
